{"file": "荒岛我为王，女神靠边站-第87集.mp4", "ep": 87, "duration": 82.6, "segments": [{"start": 0.02, "end": 0.58, "text": "吃吧"}, {"start": 2.97, "end": 3.85, "text": "這是你的呀"}, {"start": 4.17, "end": 5.69, "text": "打歸打 吃歸吃"}, {"start": 8.06, "end": 8.9, "text": "那你不餓嗎"}, {"start": 9.62, "end": 10.34, "text": "大人扛餓"}, {"start": 14.12, "end": 14.76, "text": "記住了沒有"}, {"start": 15.28, "end": 15.8, "text": "記住了"}, {"start": 16.08, "end": 17.0, "text": "下回再也不敢了"}, {"start": 17.52, "end": 19.06, "text": "林峰哥哥"}, {"start": 20.18, "end": 21.1, "text": "你惹我頭了"}, {"start": 21.1, "end": 22.98, "text": "是不是沒真生我氣啊"}, {"start": 23.54, "end": 30.18, "text": "聽這動靜"}, {"start": 30.38, "end": 31.34, "text": "挨得可不清啊"}, {"start": 32.52, "end": 33.12, "text": "林諾姐"}, {"start": 33.4, "end": 34.04, "text": "你羨慕啊"}, {"start": 34.56, "end": 35.56, "text": "我羨慕什麼"}, {"start": 35.84, "end": 36.76, "text": "我被罰的時候"}, {"start": 36.88, "end": 37.84, "text": "可比他印氣多了"}, {"start": 39.74, "end": 40.58, "text": "印氣的人"}, {"start": 40.58, "end": 41.54, "text": "上回抱著水缸"}, {"start": 41.54, "end": 42.26, "text": "哭了半血"}, {"start": 42.74, "end": 43.86, "text": "我那是風吹的"}, {"start": 45.95, "end": 46.95, "text": "不就一個雞蛋"}, {"start": 47.27, "end": 47.87, "text": "治癒嗎"}, {"start": 48.58, "end": 49.1, "text": "姐姐"}, {"start": 49.34, "end": 50.26, "text": "你沒看出來嗎"}, {"start": 50.66, "end": 52.26, "text": "打歸打 吃歸吃"}, {"start": 52.78, "end": 53.82, "text": "林峰自己那份"}, {"start": 53.82, "end": 54.54, "text": "一口沒動"}, {"start": 54.7, "end": 55.58, "text": "全給了小棠"}, {"start": 55.9, "end": 64.08, "text": "哭夠了就過來吃飯"}, {"start": 68.45, "end": 69.17, "text": "哭鼻子了"}, {"start": 69.41, "end": 69.97, "text": "才沒有"}, {"start": 70.17, "end": 71.25, "text": "是沙子進眼睛裡了"}, {"start": 71.53, "end": 72.77, "text": "行 沙子進眼睛"}, {"start": 72.77, "end": 73.81, "text": "還進得黃沙"}, {"start": 77.22, "end": 77.9, "text": "看懂了吧"}]}